      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**📖 DB/Redis 리소스가 포화됐나?** (USE Method) — Utilization < 70% → ✅ 여유 | > 80% → ⚠️ 증설 검토 | 100% 접근 → ❌ 커넥션 풀 포화"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "PG Pool Usage",
      "description": "PostgreSQL 커넥션 풀 사용률 (%).\nactive / total * 100\n정상: < 70%\n경고: > 80%",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093"
          },
          "expr": "sum(codehub_postgresql_pool_active) / sum(codehub_postgresql_pool_total) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "PG Usage %"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
